<Programs Use="Context">
<Program Use="Context" Name="MainProgram">
<Routines Use="Context">
<Routine Use="Context" Name="VF101_Medium_FeederVFD">
<RLLContent Use="Context">
<Rung Use="Target" Number="0" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIC(Device[5].Output)OTE(VF101_Medium_Feeder:O.Start);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="1" Type="N">
<Text>
<![CDATA[XIO(Device[5].Output)OTE(VF101_Medium_Feeder:O.Stop);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="2" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Compute the setpoint in Hz from the setpoint in % that comes in from the HMI - (SetpointHMI in % * 60 = SP in Hz to be sent to VFD) - so 10% speed * 60 = 600 = 6.00 Hz in VFD]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[CPT(VF101_Medium_Feeder:O.FreqCommand,VF101.SP_HMI*60);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="3" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Take the setpoint being written to the drive and convert it to Frequency in Hz]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(VF101_Medium_Feeder:O.FreqCommand,100,VF101.FreqHz_Real);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="4" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Read the actual drive output in Hz from the drive and scale to a decimal - so 600 = 6.00]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[DIV(VF101_Medium_Feeder:I.OutputFreq,100,VF101.OT_Actual_Hz);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="5" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Manual  Permissives]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(Device[5].PermissivesMan);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
<Rung Use="Target" Number="6" Type="N">
<Comment>
<![CDATA[Auto Permissives]]>
</Comment>
<Text>
<![CDATA[OTE(Device[5].PermissivesAuto);]]>
</Text>
</Rung>
</RLLContent>
</Routine>
</Routines>
</Program>
</Programs>
</Controller>
</RSLogix5000Content>
